              "text": "Choose stick welding (SMAW) for your 0.5-inch steel without shielding gas. This process is recommended for your moderate skill level, outdoor location, and unavailable gas supply.\n\nSources: files/selection-chart.pdf p.1\n\nStick welding requires no shielding gas, works in outdoor or windy conditions, and handles steel up to 0.5 inch thick. The process rating matches moderate skill.\n\nSources: files/selection-chart.pdf p.1\n\nKey advantages for your setup are ideal performance in outdoor or windy conditions, tolerance for rusty or dirty steel, and deep penetration suited for thicker materials.\n\nSources: files/selection-chart.pdf p.1"
